  "reference": "1 Sang'Weli 15",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kūnema Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli walī wang'wīla ū Saulo, “Ū SEEBA akanitūma ū nene kūkwitīīla maguta gīkī ūbize ntemi wa banhū bakwe a Baisilaeli, na lūūlū yigwaage gete ī mihayo ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ū Ndūji wa shose alīhaya gīkī, ‘A Baamaleki nakūbinha nsaango kūlwa mihayo īyo bakabīītīla a Baisilaeli aho bakabanyama mu nzīla ng'wikanza lya kūfuma Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, jaga ūkalwe būlūgū nabo a Baamaleki ūshikenaagūle gete pyī ī shikolo shabo; na a boi yaya ū kūbalekeela, babūlagage bose pyī ūmo bagelelile, bagosha na bakīma, na a baana pye na a beeleele; nī ng'ombe, ng'holo, ngamīla; būyaga nī nzobe.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūbitana a banhū biza kwibilinga Telaimu; aho wababala būshika bashilikale shihūmbī magana abīlī a ba kūshimīza wa magūlū, a ba kūfuma Yuda a bene būbiza shihūmbī ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Saulo nī libità lyakwe ūja ū kū nzengo gwa Baamaleki, ūūkibanda mu mongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalīmo na Bakeni, a bene ūbawīla, “Īngagi ū mu Baamaleki mulekane nabo, natizūmukenaagūla hamò nabo. Nguno a bing'we mukabīītīla yawiza a Baisilaeli a bose aho baafumaga Misili.” Na lūūlū a Bakeni bikomanya bīnga ū mu Baamaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo wandya kwilwisha būlūgū nabo a Baamaleki, ūbandīja ba kwipandī lya Havila, ūja akūbatūlaga kūshisha Shūūli, kīya ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Baamaleki witanagwa Agagi, ūndima alī mpanga gīko, a banhū a bangī ū Saulo ūbamala pye kūbabūlaga wa līlūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Saulo na a bashilikale bakwe būneka ū Agagi, nī ng'holo ī jawiza nī ng'ombe, nī ndama ī ng'īnu na a baana ba ng'holo pyī ījo jali jawiza wiza būjileka ū kūjikenaagūla. Alīyo īja būbibūbi, nūūlū ndebu lebu, būjibūlaga pye gete ī jenījo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūgwa mu būhūbi atamanile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ū Sang'weli kūhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nalī na būpīna kūlwa kūng'wīta ū Saulo kūbiza ntemi, nguno wagalūkile ī haha ūnileka, atūshishikīlījaga ī shilagīlo shane.” Ū Sang'weli akakoya no ū būjikū wenūbo, ūkeeyūla akūnīlīīlaga ū SEEBA! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wela ī ntondo yaho ī dilū, ūja kūmona ū Saulo alīyo ūwīlwa, “Ū Saulo wajile Kalimeli kwīmīīlīja lī gīnhū, bayūlībona a banhū baang'wizūkwa; ūlū alīnge ū kwenūko akūja Giligaali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli aho wakampandīka nose, ū Saulo ūhaya, “SEEBA akwīlūkīle mbango, naashishikīlīgije ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūmūūja, “Al'ī ng'holo ījo nalījiigwa jikūng'aalaga, nī ng'ombe ījo naliigwa jikūkumbaga, ja kinehe najo hangī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūhaya, “A bashilikale baajenhile kūfuma ū kū Baamaleki; baalekeelile ng'holo na ng'ombe ī jawiza, tūjenha kūlwa kūjifunya shitambò kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako, lelo ī jingī twajibūlagile pye gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshika henaho ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla, “Huumūlaga! Degelekaga nakūwīle īyo waniwīlaga SEEBA ū būjikū ūbo wabītaga lelo.” Ū Saulo ūsadūka ūhaya, “Niwīlage!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūwīlwa nsango gwakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla, “Ū bebe nūūlū īkī wibonaga ī kale gīkī ūlī ndo, ūtigeleelilwe mhayo gose gose, angū ūtītilwe kūbiza ntwe gwa ng'anda ja Baisilaeli? Tūhaya ū SEEBA akakwitīīla magūta ūkwīta kūbiza ntemi wa Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama walī wakūtūmile nīmo ūkūwīla gīkī, ‘Jaga ūkababūlage pye gete a banhū benabo, a Baamaleki, nguno babūbi no; ūkilwishe nabo būlūgū kūshisha ūbamale gete.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibūlī lūūlū walekile ū kūng'wigwa ū SEEBA? Nguno kī wajigwīlīīlile ī nding'wa jenīji, wīta yabūbi gīko mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Saulo ūhaya, “Naaligwile gete ī lilaka lya ng'wa SEEBA ū nene, nūja nūūkagwīta ū nīmo ūyo walī wanitūmile. Nūūbabūlaga pye a Baamaleki, ū ntemi wabo ū Agagi nūng'wenha kūūnū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu nding'wa ījo jalī ja kūkenaagūlwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, a bashilikale būjisola pyī ī ng'holo nī ng'ombe ījo jalī jawiza, būjenha Giligaali kūlwa kūmfunīja shitambò SEEBA Mulungu wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Sang'weli ūshosha alīhaya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūhaya, “Naahūbile nguno naalekile ū kūshishikīlīja ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA nī mihayo yako, nakabogoha a banhū nīdegeleka ī mihayo yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī haha nalīkwikūmbīlīja ūnikūlīlwe ū būkenaagūji wane, tūshoke dege naje nakanamye ū SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla, “Ū nene natīko ū kūshoka hamò nang'ho; ū bebe īkī wagūlemile ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA, nū wei wakūlemaga, ūtikala ho a ha būtemi wa Baisilaeli!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli aho wagalūka gīkī aje, ū Saulo ūndima ī ng'hanjo yakwe ha neno yūtandūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla, “Ī lelo yenīyī ū SEEBA wabūtandūla ū būtemi wa Baisilaeli kūwīnja ū mu nkono gwako; wamalaga kūng'winha nzenganwa ng'wiyo, ūyo alī wawiza kūkūtinda ū bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū wei ūyo alī Ikūjo lya Isilaeli atalomalomaga, nūūlū atagalūchaga maganiko; atabizile gītī banhū gīkī agalūche a maganiko gakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūshosha alīhaya, “Nalī ng'hūbi, gwike nalīkūlomba ūninhe ī likūjo lyane ū kū būtongi wa banamhala bane, nū kū būtongi wa Baisilaeli; wize hamò nane naje nakanamye ū SEEBA Mulungu wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūshoka hamò nū Saulo, ū Saulo ūnamya ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho ū Sang'weli ūhaya, “Ng'wenhagi aha ū Agagi ū ntemi wa Baamaleki.” Ū Agagi wiza wabalaganaga, aliganika, “Ī mihayo yabūbi ī y'icha yamalile kūbīta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ūmo līlūshū lyako lyabenhelegije bakīma kūjimīīja baana babo, h'ūmo nū noko ī lelo akūbiza ūmò wabo ū mu kūjimīīja baana.” Na lūūlū ū Sang'weli ūmutagūla ū Agagi mapingili mapingili kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ūmūlagīla kwenūko Giligaali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
